          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On January 24, 1985, a motorist and his wife observed a white point with blue-green reflections. This point, much larger than a star, followed a straight trajectory and left no trace or trail behind. The observation lasted approximately 5 seconds before the object disappeared. No further information could be gathered about this phenomenon.",
